# Ignore generated/vendor files by default and explicitly keep project sources
# and public documentation. Add future release directories here deliberately.
*

!.gitignore
!.gitattributes
!README.md
!CONTRIBUTING.md
!requirements.txt
!source/
!source/**
!*.py
!docs/
!docs/**
!hardware/
!hardware/**
!tools/
!tools/**
!results/
!results/**
!firmware/
!firmware/**
